        "text": "Team, please update the Payment Gateways configuration across both Admin settings and Customer checkout:\n\n1. Add Razorpay Configuration in Admin Portal (Disabled by Default):\n- In Admin Settings / Payment Methods (`/admin/settings` or payment settings component):\n  - Add Razorpay gateway integration config fields:\n    - `razorpay_key_id`\n    - `razorpay_key_secret` (masked)\n    - `razorpay_webhook_secret`\n  - Gateway Status Toggle: Add a clean toggle switch labeled \"Enable Razorpay\".\n  - Default State: Set Razorpay status to `DISABLED / INACTIVE` so it does NOT appear on the customer checkout page.\n\n2. Completely Remove \"YouPI UPI\" Gateway:\n- Purge and delete all references, components, config options, endpoints, and UI buttons related to \"YouPI UPI\" (or \"YouPI\") across the entire codebase:\n  - Remove YouPI from payment method selection lists and constants.\n  - Delete any mock/SDK integration files associated with YouPI.\n  - Ensure zero residual UI or database flags remain for YouPI.\n\n3. Enforce Active Payment Methods on Customer Checkout:\n- On checkout and wallet top-up pages, ensure ONLY two payment methods are active and available for customers:\n  1. `UPI Direct` (Direct QR / UTR verification flow).\n  2. `GyftKart Wallet Balance` (Deducting from real-time customer wallet balance).\n- All other methods (Razorpay, Cards, Netbanking) must remain hidden/disabled until enabled by admin.\n\nPlease apply these payment gateway adjustments and confirm clean checkout behavior.",
